B.a3G=s(["Moved duplicate add buttons into the cat helper so ledger entries, schedules, work logs, and tasks can be created from any page.","Manual creation keeps the complete forms, saved suggestions, and selected calendar task range.","Added operational and playful idle prompts every 15 to 30 seconds; each appears twice per cycle without immediate repeats.","On phones, parsed voice results temporarily dock the helper at the bottom-right and restore its original position when closed."],t.s)
